Huh his ear looks like a bug-eaten leaf
what do you say we call him bug-eaten?

243
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:07,717
He's being cautious this isn't gonna be
like at the house bug-eaten is gonna be

244
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:09,817
extra careful to not let a skip within 20

245
00:14:09,900 --> 00:14:12,637
meters of them be
because of air resistance

246
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:17,897
ball bearings lose accuracy when traveling
over 20 meters with a bullet nose like

247
00:14:17,980 --> 00:14:20,037
this we'll be able to
hit our mark up to 70

248
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:22,857
meters away will I have
to launch that with

249
00:14:22,940 --> 00:14:28,877
my stand's hand too because I don't think
I'm ready for that just yet point taken

250
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:34,857
I'll have to be the one to do it hold it

251
00:14:34,940 --> 00:14:38,077
right there just what
are you trying to say

